**Given:**

(1)/(2)+(1)/(6)+(1)/(12)+(1)/(20)+(1)/(30)+(1)/(42)+(1)/(56)+(1)/(72)+(1)/(90)+(1)/(110)=?

**Calculations****:**

dfrac{1}{2}+dfrac{1}{6}+dfrac{1}{12}+dfrac{1}{20}+dfrac{1}{30}+dfrac{1}{42}+dfrac{1}{56}+dfrac{1}{72}+dfrac{1}{90}+dfrac{1}{110}

dfrac{1}{1times 2}+dfrac{1}{2 times 3}+dfrac{1}{3 times 4}+dfrac{1}{4 times 5}+dfrac{1}{5 times 6}+dfrac{1}{6 ×7}+dfrac{1}{7 times 8}+dfrac{1}{8 times 9}+dfrac{1}{9 times 10}+dfrac{1}{10 times 11}

= (1 - dfrac{1}{2}) + (dfrac{1}{2} - dfrac{1}{3}) + (dfrac{1}{3} - dfrac{1}{4}) + (dfrac{1}{4} - dfrac{1}{5}) + (dfrac{1}{5} - dfrac{1}{6}) + dfrac{1}{6} - dfrac{1}{7}) + (dfrac{1}{7} - dfrac{1}{8}) + (dfrac{1}{8} - dfrac{1}{9}) + (dfrac{1}{9} - dfrac{1}{10}) + (dfrac{1}{10} - dfrac{1}{11})

All the terms get canceled out and 1 and -1/11 is left.

= 1 - dfrac{1}{11}

= dfrac{11 - 1}{11}

= dfrac{10}{11}

∴**The answer is ** dfrac{10}{11}

