**Calculation:**

By cross multiplication method,

dfrac{x}{{√ {252} }} = dfrac{{√ {175} }}{x}

⇒ x² = √{{5}times{5}times{7}} × √{{6}times{6}times{7}}

⇒ x² = 5√{7} × 6√{7}

⇒ x² = 210

⇒** x = √{210}**** **

